      "finish_reason": "stop",
      "text": "```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, Request, JSONResponse\nfrom time import monotonic\nfrom typing import Dict, List\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\nrate_limits: Dict[str, List[float]] = {}\n\n@app.middleware(\"http\")\nasync def rate_limit_middleware(request: Request, call_next):\n    client_host = request.client.host\n    timestamps = rate_limits.get(client_host, [])\n    now = monotonic()\n    timestamps = [t for t in timestamps if t > now - 60]\n    if len(timestamps) < 2:\n        timestamps.append(now)\n    else:\n        return JSONResponse(status_code=429, content={\"detail\": \"Too Many Requests\"})\n    rate_limits[client_host] = timestamps[:2]\n    return await call_next(request)\n```\n\nThis middleware limits requests to 2 per client in 60 seconds, returning 429 on the third request.",
